OL,3,AProtest against talk by academic who
OL,4,Amade Arday plagiarism claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have gathered to
OL,7,Fprotest against a talk at an Oxford
OL,8,FUniversity college by the academic who
OL,9,Faccused the late Professor Jason Arday
OL,10,Fof plagiarism.
OL,12,FStand Up To Racism organised a
OL,13,Fdemonstration against Nathan Cofnas's
OL,14,Ftalk at Oriel College, organised by
OL,15,FOxford Reform UK, on Tuesday evening.
OL,17,FProtesters, some with face masks on,
OL,18,Fappeared to try to block the entrance
OL,19,Fgates to stop people getting into the
OL,20,Fcollege before the talk.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
