OL,3,AProtest against talk by academic who
OL,4,Amade Arday plagiarism claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of protesters held signs saying
OL,7,F"Nathan Cofnas not welcome" and
OL,8,F"Remember Professor Jason Arday".
